<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<index version="1" name="STEMwerk-reaper">
  <category name="STEMwerk-reaper">
    <reapack name="STEMwerk-reaper" type="script" desc="Local stem separation for REAPER with cross-platform setup, GPU/CPU backend detection, toolbar actions, and in-place stem workflows.">
      <version name="2.3.0.7" author="flarkAUDIO" time="1785067200">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
STEMwerk 2.3.0.7 - ReaPack distribution hotfix

- Fixes ReaPack installs on Linux (managed Python 3.12) failing Repair with audio_separator_install_failed: the managed diffq wheel was missing from the ReaPack package (hole present since 2.3.0.0). After updating: run STEMwerk Setup → Repair once.

STEMwerk 2.3.0.6 - Narrow corrective runtime hotfix

- Fails Apple Silicon Repair safely before runtime cleanup when its bundled recovery payload is unavailable.
- Verifies NumPy/Numba compatibility with real imports and a compiled JIT probe.
- Resolves the DrumSep catalog checkpoint to the managed canonical file without processing-time alias copies.
]]></changelog>
